e Romanian MFA scholarship language route, closed 2026 call and an original degree-choice and document-dependency worksheet before preparing a future application.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/day25/application-workspace-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-11-23\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-11-23\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/scholarships/romanian-government-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is a 2027 Romanian MFA deadline confirmed here?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The reviewed owner page still displays the past 2026 call; reopen it for a new announcement.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does an English application portal mean an English master’s?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Match the teaching language to the actual degree route in the owner instructions.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the worksheet an official application form?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. It is an original planning aid; apply only by the current owner’s required method.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L1a"}],false,"$L1b","$L1c"]}]
